.TH "LAGO" "1" "Aug 2026" "Lago CLI" "Lago CLI Manual"

.SH NAME
lago-organizations-update - Update your organization


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBlago organizations update [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
This endpoint is used to update your own organization's settings.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--address-line1\fP=""
	The first line of your organization's billing address.

.PP
\fB--address-line2\fP=""
	The second line of your organization's billing address.

.PP
\fB--billing-configuration-document-locale\fP=""
